--   * Preserves all 4 remote-only migration records & legacy runtime-needed
--     objects (public.clinic_check_and_consume_ai_allowance(),
--     idx_subscriptions_unique_tenant_id) while upgrading staging (remote_79)
--     to full parity with canonical commit 29c75164 / cd6d708e (local_98)
