-- Conflict-free sequential prefix: 20261007 (ADIM-036 / Faz E1)
-- Description: Phase 5 Node 3 Health Tourism Treatment Journey, Quote & Itinerary Domain
-- Hardening:
--   - REVOKE ALL ON TABLE ... FROM PUBLIC, anon, authenticated; GRANT ALL TO service_role;
--   - Reject non-array p_items in ht_create_or_update_journey_quote.
